        "section": "literature",
        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "Drama",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "5. MELOPOEIA (song/music)\n   The musical element. Choral odes were sung and danced.\n   Greek tragedy was a total audiovisual spectacle."
    },
    {
      "id": "03-DRAMA.md#013",
      "path": [
        "03-DRAMA.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
      "metadata": {
