        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "Drama",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "6. OPSIS (spectacle/visual)\n   Costumes, masks, stage machinery, visual effects.\n   Aristotle ranks this LAST — \"least connected to the art of\n   poetry\" — because it depends on production, not writing."
    },
