      "text": "```\nANAGNORISIS TYPES (Aristotle identifies several)\n-------------------------------------------------\nSimple: recognition of a person (Odysseus and his scar)\nComplex: recognition combined with peripeteia (see below)\nBest: hero recognizes own identity or the consequences\n      of their own actions\n      — Oedipus discovers he IS the murderer he sought\n      — This is the model case: the recognition IS the reversal"
    },
    {
