      },
      "text": "**Peripeteia** — reversal of fortune. The moment when the action turns in the opposite direction from what was expected."
    },
    {
      "id": "03-DRAMA.md#024",
      "path": [
        "03-DRAMA.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
