        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "Drama",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "```\nPERIPETEIA\n----------\nNot just any change in fortune.\nSpecifically: an action done in one expectation\n              produces the OPPOSITE result."
    },
