        "title": "Drama",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "The Messenger in Oedipus Rex comes to bring good news:\n  He will tell Oedipus his father (Polybus) has died\n  naturally, so Oedipus need not fear the prophecy.\n  Instead, he reveals that Oedipus was adopted —\n  and this information destroys him."
    },
